<article{{ attributes }}>

  {# ── Hero ── #}
  <div class="tamu-collection-hero" style="background-image: url('https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/c99%2Fimage-06816-8eb2b1ab-f87a-4d4f-adbd-2d80e431df54.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
    <div class="tamu-collection-hero__overlay">
      <div class="container">
        <h1 class="tamu-collection-hero__title">Statement of Use</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ── Body ── #}
  <div class="container tamu-about-body">
    {{ title_suffix }}

    <div class="tamu-about-body__intro">
      <h2>How we provide access to our digital collections</h2>
      <p>We strive to respect copyright, privacy, publicity, and trademark rights in all materials. If you believe your
      rights have not been properly acknowledged, please contact us so that we may update our records and holdings.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="tamu-about-body__section">
      <h2>Statement of Use</h2>
      <p>Texas A&amp;M University Libraries provide access to digital collections under the following circumstances:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The item is in the public domain.</li>
        <li>Texas A&amp;M University owns the intellectual property rights.</li>
        <li>Permission has been granted by the rights holder to make the item available.</li>
        <li>Use is consistent with the principles of fair use.</li>
        <li>No known restrictions on use exist.</li>
        <li>After due diligence, we have not identified any substantial risk of copyright infringement, privacy concerns,
        or other objections.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <hr class="tamu-about-body__divider">

    <section class="tamu-about-body__section">
      <h2>Takedown Policy</h2>
      <p>If you believe that material in our collections should be removed, please send a request to:</p>
      <address class="tamu-about-body__cite">
        <p>Robin Hutchison<br>
        Associate University Librarian, Special Collections and Archives Division<br>
        Cushing Memorial Library and Archives<br>
        Texas A&amp;M University<br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:r-hutchison@library.tamu.edu">r-hutchison@library.tamu.edu</a></p>
      </address>

      <h3>What to include in your request</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>The title and URL of the item(s) in question.</li>
        <li>The reason for the removal request.</li>
        <li>An explanation of your rights claim.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Review process</h3>
      <p>The Associate University Librarian, in consultation with Digital Collections staff and other appropriate campus
      representatives, will review the request. During this review, the material may be temporarily removed from public
      access. Once a determination has been made, the Director of Digital Collections will communicate the decision to
      the requester.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</article>
